{
  "$defs": {
    "AgentRef": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "事件归属的子智能体标识；envelope.agent 为 null 表示主智能体。\n\n- agent_id：deepagents task() 派生的子线程标识\n- role：general-purpose / explorer / coder / reviewer 或 P1 自定义\n- spawned_by_tool_call_id：派生该子智能体的 task() 工具调用 id —— 前端用它把\n  主流中的 task() 工具卡片与子智能体进度面板（message_delta 兄弟流）关联",
      "properties": {
        "agent_id": {
          "title": "Agent Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "parent_agent_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Parent Agent Id"
        },
        "role": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Role"
        },
        "spawned_by_tool_call_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Spawned By Tool Call Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "agent_id"
      ],
      "title": "AgentRef",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "TodoItem": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "todo 条目（REQ-005）。todo 面板数据源 = 最近一次 write_todos 工具调用的快照。",
      "properties": {
        "content": {
          "title": "Content",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "enum": [
            "pending",
            "in_progress",
            "completed"
          ],
          "title": "Status",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "content",
        "status"
      ],
      "title": "TodoItem",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ToolErrorObj": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "事件侧工具错误对象（tool_call_finished / browser_action）。",
      "properties": {
        "code": {
          "enum": [
            "timeout",
            "sandbox_unavailable",
            "param_invalid",
            "not_found",
            "permission_denied",
            "mcp_transport_error",
            "mcp_tool_error",
            "cancelled",
            "internal"
          ],
          "title": "Code",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "message": {
          "title": "Message",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "retryable": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Retryable"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "code",
        "message"
      ],
      "title": "ToolErrorObj",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "工具调用结束（卡片补全：出参摘要 + 状态，AC-003-2）。\n\n- error 双通道原则（调研 §4.2）：给模型仍走 ToolMessage；本事件面向 UI/落库，\n  带 status/error{code,message,retryable}/truncated/duration_ms；\n- exit_code：execute 类命令退出码（非 0 不代表 status=error —— deepagents\n  口径：命令跑了就是 success，读 exit_code 判断命令失败）；\n- todos：tool=write_todos 时携带全量 todo 快照（REQ-005 面板数据源）；\n- result_ref：大结果被 offload 后的沙箱内落盘引用（AC-010-2 留痕）。",
  "properties": {
    "agent": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/AgentRef"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    },
    "created_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Created At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "duration_ms": {
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Duration Ms",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "error": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ToolErrorObj"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    },
    "exit_code": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Exit Code"
    },
    "result_preview": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Result Preview"
    },
    "result_ref": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Result Ref"
    },
    "run_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Run Id"
    },
    "seq": {
      "description": "会话内单调递增序号；SSE id 即此值",
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Seq",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "session_id": {
      "title": "Session Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "status": {
      "enum": [
        "success",
        "error"
      ],
      "title": "Status",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "todos": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/TodoItem"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Todos"
    },
    "tool_call_id": {
      "title": "Tool Call Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "truncated": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Truncated",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "type": {
      "const": "tool_call_finished",
      "default": "tool_call_finished",
      "title": "Type",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "seq",
    "session_id",
    "created_at",
    "tool_call_id",
    "status",
    "duration_ms"
  ],
  "title": "ToolCallFinishedEvent",
  "type": "object"
}
